{"all_articles":[{"anchors":["definition"],"bibliography":[],"english_title":"Normalization","external_links":[],"html":"<h1>归一化 · Normalization</h1>\n<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<p>**归一化（normalization）**是选定基准后调整对象的大小或坐标，使它满足便于比较的标准条件。使用这个词时，需要说明采用了什么基准。</p>\n<p>例如函数 <span class=\"math inline\">f</span> 在 <span class=\"math inline\">x=a</span> 处有正的峰高 <span class=\"math inline\">M=f(a)</span>，选择正的宽度尺度 <span class=\"math inline\">w</span>，可以定义</p>\n<div class=\"math block\">\nH(t)=\\frac{f(a+wt)}{M}.\n</div>\n<p>这把峰顶移到 <span class=\"math inline\">t=0</span>，把峰高变成 <span class=\"math inline\">H(0)=1</span>，并用 <span class=\"math inline\">w</span> 作为横向单位。</p>\n<p><a href=\"#/learn/calc.stirling-formula?articles=calc.stirling-formula.gamma-integral&amp;anchor=natural-width\">斯特林讲义中的峰高与宽度归一化</a>取 <span class=\"math inline\">a=n</span>、<span class=\"math inline\">M=(n/e)^n</span>、<span class=\"math inline\">w=\\sqrt n</span>。这里没有要求 <span class=\"math inline\">H</span> 的积分等于 <span class=\"math inline\">1</span>。对于非负函数 <span class=\"math inline\">p</span>，把它除以有限且为正的总积分，才会得到积分为 <span class=\"math inline\">1</span> 的概率密度归一化。</p>\n<p>另一种例子是<a href=\"#/learn/ra.holder-inequality?anchor=holder-normalization\">Hölder 不等式中的归一化技术</a>：把选定的总量调整为 <span class=\"math inline\">1</span>。</p>\n","id":"calc.normalization.main","legacy":true,"node_id":"calc.normalization","resources":[],"schema_version":1,"title":"归一化"}],"anchors":["definition"],"articles":[{"anchors":["definition"],"bibliography":[],"english_title":"Normalization","external_links":[],"html":"<h1>归一化 · Normalization</h1>\n<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<p>**归一化（normalization）**是选定基准后调整对象的大小或坐标，使它满足便于比较的标准条件。使用这个词时，需要说明采用了什么基准。</p>\n<p>例如函数 <span class=\"math inline\">f</span> 在 <span class=\"math inline\">x=a</span> 处有正的峰高 <span class=\"math inline\">M=f(a)</span>，选择正的宽度尺度 <span class=\"math inline\">w</span>，可以定义</p>\n<div class=\"math block\">\nH(t)=\\frac{f(a+wt)}{M}.\n</div>\n<p>这把峰顶移到 <span class=\"math inline\">t=0</span>，把峰高变成 <span class=\"math inline\">H(0)=1</span>，并用 <span class=\"math inline\">w</span> 作为横向单位。</p>\n<p><a href=\"#/learn/calc.stirling-formula?articles=calc.stirling-formula.gamma-integral&amp;anchor=natural-width\">斯特林讲义中的峰高与宽度归一化</a>取 <span class=\"math inline\">a=n</span>、<span class=\"math inline\">M=(n/e)^n</span>、<span class=\"math inline\">w=\\sqrt n</span>。这里没有要求 <span class=\"math inline\">H</span> 的积分等于 <span class=\"math inline\">1</span>。对于非负函数 <span class=\"math inline\">p</span>，把它除以有限且为正的总积分，才会得到积分为 <span class=\"math inline\">1</span> 的概率密度归一化。</p>\n<p>另一种例子是<a href=\"#/learn/ra.holder-inequality?anchor=holder-normalization\">Hölder 不等式中的归一化技术</a>：把选定的总量调整为 <span class=\"math inline\">1</span>。</p>\n","id":"calc.normalization.main","legacy":true,"node_id":"calc.normalization","resources":[],"schema_version":1,"title":"归一化"}],"available_articles":[{"anchors":["definition"],"english_title":"Normalization","id":"calc.normalization.main","legacy":true,"node_id":"calc.normalization","title":"归一化"}],"bibliography":[],"contains":[],"content_status":"definition","default_articles":["calc.normalization.main"],"english_title":"Normalization","external_links":[],"html":"<h1>归一化 · Normalization</h1>\n<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<p>**归一化（normalization）**是选定基准后调整对象的大小或坐标，使它满足便于比较的标准条件。使用这个词时，需要说明采用了什么基准。</p>\n<p>例如函数 <span class=\"math inline\">f</span> 在 <span class=\"math inline\">x=a</span> 处有正的峰高 <span class=\"math inline\">M=f(a)</span>，选择正的宽度尺度 <span class=\"math inline\">w</span>，可以定义</p>\n<div class=\"math block\">\nH(t)=\\frac{f(a+wt)}{M}.\n</div>\n<p>这把峰顶移到 <span class=\"math inline\">t=0</span>，把峰高变成 <span class=\"math inline\">H(0)=1</span>，并用 <span class=\"math inline\">w</span> 作为横向单位。</p>\n<p><a href=\"#/learn/calc.stirling-formula?articles=calc.stirling-formula.gamma-integral&amp;anchor=natural-width\">斯特林讲义中的峰高与宽度归一化</a>取 <span class=\"math inline\">a=n</span>、<span class=\"math inline\">M=(n/e)^n</span>、<span class=\"math inline\">w=\\sqrt n</span>。这里没有要求 <span class=\"math inline\">H</span> 的积分等于 <span class=\"math inline\">1</span>。对于非负函数 <span class=\"math inline\">p</span>，把它除以有限且为正的总积分，才会得到积分为 <span class=\"math inline\">1</span> 的概率密度归一化。</p>\n<p>另一种例子是<a href=\"#/learn/ra.holder-inequality?anchor=holder-normalization\">Hölder 不等式中的归一化技术</a>：把选定的总量调整为 <span class=\"math inline\">1</span>。</p>\n","id":"calc.normalization","kind":"knowledge","objective":"明确所选基准，区分峰高与宽度归一化和概率密度归一化。","prerequisites":[],"related":["calc.stirling-formula","ra.holder-inequality"],"requires":[],"resources":[],"schema_version":1,"selected_article_ids":["calc.normalization.main"],"shared_resources":[],"status":"review","subject":"calculus","subjects":["calculus"],"title":"归一化"}
